<h3>匯入 CSS(Importing CSS)</h3>

<p>
  若要匯入 CSS，應使用 <code>/util/import_css.mas</code> Mason 元件，而非 <code>&lt;link&gt;</code> 元素。這可確保連結被加入至 <code>&lt;head&gt;</code> 中，而非 <code>&lt;body&gt;</code> 的一部分(To import CSS one should use the /util/import_css.mas mason component instead of a &lt;link&gt; element. This will ensure that a link is added to the &lt;head&gt; instead of being part of the &lt;body&gt;)。此 Mason 元件接受字串列表，字串須為下列之一(One provides this mason component with a list of strings which are one of the following)：
  <ul>
    <li>從 /static/css 資料夾出發的 CSS 檔案相對路徑(The relative path to the CSS file from the /static/css folder.)。</li>
    <li>指向 CSS 檔案的絕對站台路徑(The absolute site path to the CSS file.)。</li>
    <li>以通訊協定名稱開頭的 URL（例如 'http://...'）(A URL starting with the scheme name (i.e. 'http://...')).</li>
  </ul>
    <pre><%text><& /util/import_css.mas, paths => [
    'bootstrap/v1.css',
    '/css/jquery.css',
    'http://foo.bar/buzz.css'
] &></%text></pre>
</p>

<hr>

<h3>匯入 JavaScript(Importing JavaScript)</h3>

<p>
  若要匯入 JavaScript，應使用 <code>/util/import_javascript.mas</code> Mason 元件。這可確保指令碼載入至 <code>&lt;head&gt;</code> 中，而非 <code>&lt;body&gt;</code> 的一部分(To import JavaScript one should use the /util/import_javascript.mas mason component. This will ensure that the script is loaded in the &lt;head&gt; instead of being part of the &lt;body&gt;)。此 Mason 元件接受字串列表，內容為將斜線替換為點（例如 <code>s/\/\./g</code>）並移除副檔名後的 JavaScript 檔案路徑(One provides this mason component with a list of strings which are the path to the JavaScript file with slashes replaced by periods and the file extension removed)。
  <pre><%text><& /util/import_javascript.mas, classes => [qw[ CXGN.Effects MochiKit.DOM ]] &></%text></pre>
</p>

<hr>

<h3>資訊區塊(Info Sections)</h3>
<p>原始碼(Source)：</p>
<pre><%text>
&lt;&| /page/info_section.mas, id=&gt;'Example_Info_Section',
    title =&gt; 'Example Info Section', subtitle =&gt; 'This is a subtitle',
    collapsible=&gt;1, collapsed=&gt;0 &&gt;

  Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.

&lt;/&&gt;
</%text></pre>

<p>產生結果(Creates)：</p>
<&| /page/info_section.mas, id=>'Example_Info_Section',
    title => '範例資訊區塊(Example Info Section)', subtitle => '這是一段副標題(This is a subtitle)',
    collapsible=>1, collapsed=>0 &>

  Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.

</&>

<hr>

<h3>清單選取選單(List Select Menus)</h3>
<p>原始碼(Source)：</p>
<pre>
  &lt;& /util/import_javascript.mas, classes => ['CXGN.List'] &&gt;
  &lt;div id="select_div_id"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;script type="text/javascript"&gt;
    var list_obj = new CXGN.List();
    var listhtml = list_obj.listSelect('select_div_id', ['accessions'], "Select an Accession List", undefined, undefined);
    jQuery('#select_div_id').html(listhtml);
  &lt;/script&gt;
</pre>

<p>產生結果(Creates)：</p>
<div id="select_div_id"></div>
<script type="text/javascript">
  var lo = new CXGN.List();
  var listhtml = lo.listSelect('select_div_id', ['accessions'], "Select an Accession List", undefined, undefined);
  jQuery('#select_div_id').html(listhtml);
</script>
<hr>

