<h3>2 欄詳細資料頁面區塊(2 Column Detail Page Section)</h3>
<p>此區塊用於試驗詳細資料頁面與種質詳細資料頁面，理想情況下可用於所有詳細資料頁面。info_section_id 指定主要區塊中顯示的內容。按鈕可傳入 buttons_html(This section is used from trial detail page and stock detail page, but ideally it would be used on all detail pages. The info_section_id specifies what to show in the main section. Buttons can be passed into the buttons_html.)。</p>
<p>原始碼(Source)：</p>
<pre>
&lt;& /page/detail_page_2_col_section.mas,
info_section_title =&gt; "&lt;h4 style='display:inline'&gt;My Info Section&lt;/h4&gt;",
info_section_subtitle =&gt; 'View my info.',
icon_class =&gt; "glyphicon glyphicon-equalizer",
info_section_id =&gt; "",
buttons_html =&gt; "&lt;button class='btn btn-sm btn-primary' style='margin:3px' id='my_example_button'&gt;Example Button&lt;/button&gt;"
&&gt;
</pre>

<p>產生結果(Creates)：</p>
<& /page/detail_page_2_col_section.mas, info_section_title => "<h4 style='display:inline'>我的資訊區塊(My Info Section)</h4>", info_section_subtitle => '檢視我的資訊(View my info.)', icon_class => "glyphicon glyphicon-equalizer", info_section_id => "", buttons_html => "<button class='btn btn-sm btn-primary' style='margin:3px' id='my_example_button'>範例按鈕(Example Button)</button>" &>

<hr>

<h3>3 欄詳細資料頁面區塊(3 Column Detail Page Section)</h3>
