<hr>

<h3>說明工作流程的範例工作流程(An Example Workflow Explaining Workflows)</h3>

<&| /util/workflow.mas , id=> "my_workflow"&>

  <&| /util/workflow.mas:step, title=>"workflow.mas" &>
    <p>使用 <code>/util/workflow.mas</code> Mason 元件新增工作流程(Add a workflow using the /util/workflow.mas mason component)</p>
    <p><pre><%text>&lt;&amp;| /util/workflow.mas, id=> "my_workflow" &amp;&gt;...&lt;/&amp;&gt;</%text></pre></p>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" onclick="Workflow.complete(this);">下一步(Next)</button>
  </&>

  <&| /util/workflow.mas:step, title=>"新增步驟(Adding Steps)" &>
    <p>使用 <code>/util/workflow.mas:step</code> Mason 方法新增步驟至工作流程(Add steps to the workflow using the /util/workflow.mas:step mason method)。</p>
    <p>
<pre><%text>&lt;&amp;| /util/workflow.mas, id=&gt; "my_workflow" &amp;&gt;
    &lt;&amp;| /util/workflow.mas:step, title=&gt; "Step A" &amp;&gt;...&lt;/&amp;&gt;
    &lt;&amp;| /util/workflow.mas:step, title=&gt; "Another Step" &amp;&gt;...&lt;/&amp;&gt;
    ...
&lt;/&amp;&gt;</%text></pre>
    </p>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" onclick="Workflow.complete(this);">下一步(Next)</button>
  </&>

  <&| /util/workflow.mas:step, title=>"完成步驟(Completing Steps)" &>
  <p>
    使用 <code>Workflow.complete(Element)</code> JavaScript 函式來完成步驟。<code>Element</code> 應為您欲完成步驟內的任何 DOM 元素(Use the Workflow.complete(Element) JavaScript function to complete a step. Element should be any DOM element within the step you would like to complete)。
  </p>
  <p>
<pre><%text>&lt;&amp;| /util/workflow.mas, id=&gt; "my_workflow"&amp;&gt;
  &lt;&amp;| /util/workflow.mas:step, title=&gt;"workflow.mas" &amp;&gt;
    ...
    &lt;button type="button" onclick="Workflow.complete(this);"&gt;Next&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;/&amp;&gt;
  ...
&lt;/&amp;&gt;</%text></pre>
  </p>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" onclick="Workflow.complete(this);">下一步(Next)</button>
  </&>

  <&| /util/workflow.mas:step, title=>"略過步驟(Skipping Steps)" &>
  <p>
    略過步驟類似於完成步驟，但會將步驟標記為未完成。使用 <code>Workflow.skip(Element)</code>，就像使用 <code>Workflow.complete(Element)</code> 一樣(Skipping works like completing but marks the step as incomplete. Use Workflow.skip(Element) just like you would Workflow.complete(Element))。
  </p>
  <p>
<pre><%text>&lt;&amp;| /util/workflow.mas, id=&gt; "my_workflow"&amp;&gt;
  &lt;&amp;| /util/workflow.mas:step, title=&gt;"workflow.mas" &amp;&gt;
    ...
    &lt;button type="button" onclick="Workflow.skip(this);"&gt;Skip&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;/&amp;&gt;
  ...
&lt;/&amp;&gt;</%text></pre>
  </p>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" onclick="Workflow.skip(this);">略過此步驟(Skip this Step)</button>
  </&>

  <&| /util/workflow.mas:step, title=>"等待中步驟(Pending Steps)" &>
  <p>
    有時步驟需要時間才能完成，例如上傳。您可以使用 <code>Workflow.pending(Element)</code> 將步驟標記為等待中。稍後可以使用 <code>Workflow.complete(Element)</code> 完全完成該步驟(Sometimes a step needs time to complete, such as uploads. You can mark a step as pending using Workflow.pending(Element). You can later fully complete the step using Workflow.complete(Element))。
  </p>
  <p>
<pre><%text>&lt;&amp;| /util/workflow.mas, id=&gt; "my_workflow"&amp;&gt;
  &lt;&amp;| /util/workflow.mas:step, title=&gt;"workflow.mas" &amp;&gt;
    ...
    &lt;button type="button" onclick="Workflow.pending(this);"&gt;Wait&lt;/button&gt;
    &lt;button type="button" onclick="Workflow.complete(this,false);"&gt;Complete&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;/&amp;&gt;
  ...
&lt;/&amp;&gt;</%text></pre>
  </p>
  <button id="to_complete" type="button" class="btn btn-primary" onclick="Workflow.pending(this);">等待並繼續(Wait and Continue)</button>
  </&>

  <&| /util/workflow.mas:step, title=>"結束畫面(Endscreens)" &>
  <p>
    在完成最後一步後，將顯示結束畫面。若要設定結束畫面的內容，請使用 <code>/util/workflow.mas:complete</code> Mason 方法。您也可以選擇使用 <code>/util/workflow.mas:pending</code> 設定在尚有等待中步驟時顯示的特殊結束畫面(After the final step is completed, an endscreen will be shown. To set the content of the endscreen, use the /util/workflow.mas:complete mason method. You can also optionally set a special endscreen which is shown instead while there are pending steps using /util/workflow.mas:pending)。
  </p>
  <p>
<pre><%text>&lt;&amp;| /util/workflow.mas, id=&gt; "my_workflow"&amp;&gt;
  ...
  &lt;&amp;| /util/workflow.mas:complete &amp;&gt; ... &lt;/&amp;&gt;
  &lt;&amp;| /util/workflow.mas:pending &amp;&gt; ... &lt;/&amp;&gt;
&lt;/&amp;&gt;</%text></pre>
  </p>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" onclick="Workflow.complete(this);">前往結束畫面(Go to endscreen)</button>
  </&>

  <&| /util/workflow.mas:pending &>
    <h2>仍有等待中的步驟。請完成它以檢視最終結束畫面。(There is still a pending step. Complete it to see the final endscreen.)</h2>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" onclick="Workflow.complete(document.querySelector('#to_complete'),false);">完成等待中步驟(Complete Pending Step)</button>
  </&>
  <&| /util/workflow.mas:complete &>
    <h1>恭喜，您已完成此工作流程！(Congratulations, you've made it through the workflow!)</h1>
    <h4>以下是一些其他提示與訣竅(Here are some other tips and tricks)：</h4>
    <p>若要設定工作流程目前可見的步驟，請使用(To set the currently visible step of the workflow use)</p>
    <pre>var wf = document.querySelector("#my_workflow");
Workflow.focus(wf,step_index);</pre>
    <p>
      預設情況下，<code>Workflow.complete(...)</code>、<code>Workflow.skip(...)</code> 與 <code>Workflow.pending(...)</code> 也會將焦點切換至下一步。有時您需要在不更改焦點的情況下將步驟設定為完成。若要這樣做，請將 <code>false</code> 作為第二個引數傳入(By default, Workflow.complete(...), Workflow.skip(...), and Workflow.pending(...) also change the focus to the next step. Sometimes, you need to set a step to complete without changing the focus. To do this, pass false as the second argument)。
    </p>
    <pre>Workflow.complete(Element,false);
Workflow.skip(Element,false);
Workflow.pending(Element,false);</pre>
  </&>
</&>

<hr>

<h3>Vega(-lite) Graphs</h3>

<p>
    Using <a href="https://vega.github.io/vega-lite/">vega-lite</a> is an easy and quick way to make graphs in the db. Simply include vega-lite:
    <pre><%text><& /util/import_javascript.mas, classes => [qw[ vega.vega3 vega.vega-lite2 vega.vega-embed3 vega.vega-defaults ]] &></%text></pre>
    set up a div:
<pre><%text>&lt;div id="vis"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</%text></pre>
    and then run vega-lite (you can also use a <a href="https://vega.github.io/vega/">vega</a> graph spec):
<pre><%text>&lt;script type="text/javascript"&gt;
    var yourVlSpec = {
      "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v2.0.json",
      "description": "A simple bar chart with embedded data.",
      "data": {
        "values": [
          {"a": "A","b": 28}, {"a": "B","b": 55}, {"a": "C","b": 43},
          {"a": "D","b": 91}, {"a": "E","b": 81}, {"a": "F","b": 53},
          {"a": "G","b": 19}, {"a": "H","b": 87}, {"a": "I","b": 52}
        ]
      },
      "mark": "bar",
      "encoding": {
        "x": {"field": "a", "type": "ordinal"},
        "y": {"field": "b", "type": "quantitative"}
      }
    }
    vegaEmbed("#vis", yourVlSpec, window.VEGA_DEFAULTS);
  &lt;/script&gt;</%text></pre>
</p>
to create:
<& /util/import_javascript.mas, classes => [qw[ vega.vega3 vega.vega-lite2 vega.vega-embed3 vega.vega-defaults ]] &>
<div>
  <div id="vis"></div>
</div>
<script type="text/javascript">
    var yourVlSpec = {
      "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v2.0.json",
      "description": "A simple bar chart with embedded data.",
      "data": {
        "values": [
          {"a": "A","b": 28}, {"a": "B","b": 55}, {"a": "C","b": 43},
          {"a": "D","b": 91}, {"a": "E","b": 81}, {"a": "F","b": 53},
          {"a": "G","b": 19}, {"a": "H","b": 87}, {"a": "I","b": 52}
        ]
      },
      "mark": "bar",
      "encoding": {
        "x": {"field": "a", "type": "ordinal"},
        "y": {"field": "b", "type": "quantitative"}
      }
    }
    vegaEmbed("#vis", yourVlSpec, window.VEGA_DEFAULTS);
</script>

<hr>

<h3>Field Trials Search Datatable</h3>
<p>Source:</p>
<pre>
    &lt;div class="well"&gt;
    &lt;table id="trial_search_results" width="100%" class="table table-hover table-striped"&gt;
    &lt;thead&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
        &lt;th&gt;Trial name&lt;/th&gt;
        &lt;th&gt;Description&lt;/th&gt;
        &lt;th&gt;Breeding program&lt;/th&gt;
        &lt;th&gt;Folder&lt;/th&gt;
        &lt;th&gt;Year&lt;/th&gt;
        &lt;th&gt;Location&lt;/th&gt;
        &lt;th&gt;Trial type&lt;/th&gt;
        &lt;th&gt;Design&lt;/th&gt;
        &lt;th&gt;Planting Date&lt;/th&gt;
        &lt;th&gt;Harvest Date&lt;/th&gt;
        &lt;th&gt;Download&lt;/th&gt;
    &lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;/thead&gt;
    &lt;/table&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;script type="text/javascript"&gt;
    var trial_table = jQuery('#trial_search_results').DataTable( {
        'ajax': {
            'url':'/ajax/search/trials',
            'data': function(d) {
                d.select_checkbox_name = 'create_tissue_sample_select_trial';
            }
        }
    });
    &lt;/script&gt;
</pre>

<p>產生結果(Creates)：</p>
<div class="well">
<table id="styleguide_trial_search_results" width="100%" class="table table-hover table-striped">
<thead>
  <tr>
    <th>選取(Select)</th>
    <th>試驗名稱(Trial name)</th>
    <th>描述(Description)</th>
    <th>育種計畫(Breeding program)</th>
    <th>資料夾(Folder)</th>
    <th>年份(Year)</th>
    <th>地點(Location)</th>
    <th>試驗類型(Trial type)</th>
    <th>設計(Design)</th>
    <th>種植日期(Planting Date)</th>
    <th>收穫日期(Harvest Date)</th>
    <th>下載(Download)</th>
</tr>
</thead>
</table>
</div>
<script type="text/javascript">
var styleguide_trial_table = jQuery('#styleguide_trial_search_results').DataTable( {
    'ajax': {
        'url':'/ajax/search/trials',
        'data': function(d) {
            d.select_checkbox_name = 'styleguide_select_trial';
        }
    }
});
</script>

