<h3>符號使用規範(Use of Symbols)</h3>

<p>
  下表為資料庫中目前符號的使用情況。當您選擇使用新符號時，請將其新增至此表(Below is a table with current usages of symbols in the database. Please add to this table when you choose to use a new symbol)。
</p>
<style media="screen">
  .symbol-table>tbody>tr>td{
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .symbol-table>tbody>tr>td:first-of-type>*{
    font-size:2.5em;
  }
</style>
<table class="table symbol-table">
  <tr>
    <th>符號(Symbol)</th>
    <th>用途與情境(Usages and contexts)</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-dashboard"></span></td>
    <td>
      <ul>
        <li>試驗詳細資料頂部區塊(Trial Details Top Section)[試驗詳細資料(Trial Detail)]</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-align-left"></span></td>
    <td>
      <ul>
        <li>JBrowse[試驗詳細資料(Trial Detail)]</li>
        <li>JBrowse[種質詳細資料(Stock Detail)]</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-book"></span></td>
    <td>
      <ul>
        <li>文獻註解(Literature Annotation)[種質詳細資料(Stock Detail)]</li>
        <li>上傳表型資料(Upload Phenotype Data)[首頁說明(Homepage Help)]</li>
      </ul>
